<title>CHINA: Shanghai stock exchange closed on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Shanghai stock exchange closed on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai stock exchange will be closed on Wednesday for the New Year holiday, an exchange statement said.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, Shanghai's domestic A share index closed down 18.484 points or 1.90 percent to 954.983 points and the foreign currency B share index edged down 0.035 point or 0.05 percent to 67.026 points.</p>
</text>
